<section class="s-actions" style="max-width:1180px;margin:24px auto 0"><div class="s-actions-head"><div><span class="kicker">Scope 1 · 2 · 3</span><h2>Beregn karbonmåling</h2><p>Aktivitet × utslippsfaktor gir en sporbar foreløpig verdi. Kvalitetssikring kreves før rapportering.</p></div><span class="hitl-badge">HITL · påkrevd</span></div><form data-s-action="calculate_carbon" style="margin-top:16px;display:grid;gap:9px"><label>Aktivitet<input name="title" maxlength="240" required placeholder="Elektrisitet · lokasjon Oslo" /></label><div class="form-row"><label>Scope<select name="scope"><option value="scope_1">Scope 1</option><option value="scope_2">Scope 2</option><option value="scope_3">Scope 3</option></select></label><label>Enhet<input name="valueUnit" maxlength="30" value="kg CO₂e" required /></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Mengde<input name="activityNumeric" type="number" min="0" step="0.001" required placeholder="1000" /></label><label>Faktor<input name="emissionFactor" type="number" min="0" step="0.000001" required placeholder="0.12" /></label></div><button type="submit">Beregn og registrer</button></form></section>
